# Era 4 of The Quota (year 70, the closure, one month in late autumn; design/eras/era4.md): its sixteen places wired
# as areas on their own plates (plates agent, 2026-10-22; render/places/q4_*.mjs, baked by render/bake_era4.sh).
# Loaded by the shell beside wiring/quota-areas.lwd (ui/app.mjs content=quota). The tower and the Sheaf are era 4's
# own plates of era 2's places (q4_tower, q4_sheaf), so era 2's areas are untouched.
# hud-clock and hud-weather: the hour and the weather the HUD shows here while @meta hud-held holds (var.era == 4,
# content/quota/slice.lwd), read by ui/hudtab.mjs. Mira's kitchen is year 103: the witness shows no weather.
# No figures yet: era 4's cast has no sculpted figures; the scenes' speakers show on the talk page only.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the wide lens: the town at the closure
@area q4.tower
name: The bell tower over Exchange Street
plate: q4_tower
place: q4_tower
lens: wide
variant: dusk
hud-clock: 17:40
hud-weather: late autumn, the first sodium
spawn: 0 0 1.5
camera: 0.6

